{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"sec43-header","type":"text","x":0,"y":-300,"width":3540,"height":235,"text":"# 证券工具与现金流权利\n\n[[02_Economy/06_证券投资学/01_证券工具与现金流权利|从连续课程开始]] · [[02_Economy/06_证券投资学/01_证券投资工具|回到课堂记录]]\n\n先识别权利 → 列现金流与选择权 → 判断资产池与交易渠道 → 合并成本核算回报。\n按编号阅读各区；概念名称直达定义，窄结论另有自己的节点。颜色仅分板块，不表示掌握度。"},
		{"id":"rights-group","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":1740,"height":830,"label":"1 · 权利与受偿：谁得到什么","color":"5"},
		{"id":"bonds-group","type":"group","x":1800,"y":0,"width":1740,"height":830,"label":"2 · 债券现金流：规则与选择权","color":"4"},
		{"id":"funds-group","type":"group","x":0,"y":910,"width":1740,"height":930,"label":"3 · 基金：法律形态 × 申赎 × 交易 × 投资目标","color":"6"},
		{"id":"deriv-group","type":"group","x":1800,"y":910,"width":1740,"height":930,"label":"4 · 衍生工具：承诺、选择、计算基数","color":"2"},
		{"id":"use-group","type":"group","x":0,"y":1920,"width":1740,"height":830,"label":"5 · 业务应用与结构：套保、交割、信用","color":"1"},
		{"id":"returns-group","type":"group","x":1800,"y":1920,"width":1740,"height":830,"label":"6 · 回报：支付 → 损益 → 跨期增长","color":"3"},
		{"id":"rights","type":"text","x":40,"y":70,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[证券权利识别]]\n\n先找主体、支付日、条件与选择权；未给条款保持未知。"},
		{"id":"stock","type":"text","x":620,"y":70,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[股票]]\n\n证券承载股权；二级买入款付给卖方。"},
		{"id":"bond","type":"text","x":1200,"y":70,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[债券]]\n\n证券承载约定债权；承诺与实际兑现分开。"},
		{"id":"common","type":"text","x":40,"y":340,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[普通股]]\n\n参与分配，清算取得非优先剩余。"},
		{"id":"preferred","type":"text","x":620,"y":340,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[优先股]]\n\n对普通股的特定优先权，以条款为准。"},
		{"id":"priority","type":"text","x":1200,"y":340,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[受偿顺序]]\n\n先限定同一主体和资源，再排请求权。"},
		{"id":"limited","type":"text","x":40,"y":610,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[有限责任]]\n\n限定股东额外责任，不保证投资本金。"},
		{"id":"allocation","type":"text","x":620,"y":610,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[股债到期分配]]\n\n一层债务等条件下：债权取 min，股权取剩余。"},
		{"id":"security","type":"text","x":1200,"y":610,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[资产担保与第三方保证]]\n\n特定资产上的权利，与新增保证义务人不同。"},
		{"id":"zero","type":"text","x":1840,"y":70,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[零息债券]]\n\n没有期间息票；仍需读取到期偿付与违约条款。"},
		{"id":"fixed","type":"text","x":2420,"y":70,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[固定息票债券]]\n\n票面利率固定；金额另看本金与计息期间。\n固定金额、日期且排除违约与选择权后，进入 [[固定现金流债券定价]]。"},
		{"id":"float","type":"text","x":3000,"y":70,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[浮动利率债券]]\n\n利率基准重置息票率；加点固定不等于息票固定。"},
		{"id":"inflation","type":"text","x":1840,"y":340,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[通胀挂钩债券]]\n\n指定物价指数调整本金或息票。"},
		{"id":"callable","type":"text","x":2420,"y":340,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[可赎回债券]]\n\n发行人按条款选择提前赎回。"},
		{"id":"puttable","type":"text","x":3000,"y":340,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[可回售债券]]\n\n持有人按条款选择回售。"},
		{"id":"convertible","type":"text","x":1840,"y":610,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[可转换债券]]\n\n持有人按条款把债权转换为股份。"},
		{"id":"bondvaluation","type":"text","x":2420,"y":610,"width":1080,"height":140,"text":"### [[固定现金流债券定价]]\n\n排除违约和未决选择权后，逐笔按期限贴现。"},
		{"id":"fund","type":"text","x":40,"y":980,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[证券投资基金]]\n\n资产池与管理公司分开；持有份额不是直接取走底层资产。"},
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","x":620,"y":980,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[基金份额净值]]\n\n对应净资产 ÷ 存续份额；估值不保证即时成交。"},
		{"id":"discount","type":"text","x":1200,"y":980,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[基金折溢价]]\n\n比较同口径市价与净值；偏离收敛仍可能亏损。"},
		{"id":"contractual","type":"text","x":40,"y":1190,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[契约型基金]]\n\n通过基金合同组织权利与管理关系。"},
		{"id":"company","type":"text","x":620,"y":1190,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[公司型基金]]\n\n通过基金公司及其股份组织投资者权利。"},
		{"id":"index","type":"text","x":1200,"y":1190,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[指数基金]]\n\n追踪指定基准是投资目标，不是交易渠道。"},
		{"id":"open","type":"text","x":40,"y":1400,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[开放式基金]]\n\n依约新增或注销份额；申赎与投资者间转让不同。"},
		{"id":"closed","type":"text","x":620,"y":1400,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[封闭式基金]]\n\n资本安排不提供持续赎回权；退出需看转售等渠道。"},
		{"id":"fof","type":"text","x":1200,"y":1400,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[基金中基金]]\n\n主要持有其他基金；穿透持仓检查重复风险与费用。"},
		{"id":"etf","type":"text","x":40,"y":1610,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[ETF]]\n\n二级交易 + 大额创设赎回；不必被动或只持股票。"},
		{"id":"lof","type":"text","x":620,"y":1610,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[上市开放式基金]]\n\nLOF 同时提供上市交易和约定申赎渠道。"},
		{"id":"etflink","type":"text","x":1200,"y":1610,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[ETF申赎价格联结]]\n\n资格、篮子可成交、锁价和成本决定能否纠偏。"},
		{"id":"derivative","type":"text","x":1840,"y":980,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[衍生工具]]\n\n按标的或约定变量确定支付；不自动拥有底层。"},
		{"id":"forward","type":"text","x":2420,"y":980,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[远期合约]]\n\n双方承诺未来交换；K 与合约当前市值不同。"},
		{"id":"futures","type":"text","x":3000,"y":980,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[期货合约]]\n\n标准化与逐日结算；最终盈利仍可能途中缺现金。"},
		{"id":"option","type":"text","x":1840,"y":1280,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[期权]]\n\n持有人有行权选择，卖方承担对应义务。"},
		{"id":"call","type":"text","x":2420,"y":1280,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[看涨期权]]\n\n买入权利；到期 max(S−K,0)，不是今天价格。"},
		{"id":"put","type":"text","x":3000,"y":1280,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[看跌期权]]\n\n卖出权利；到期 max(K−S,0)，不是卖出期权。"},
		{"id":"swap","type":"text","x":1840,"y":1580,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[金融互换]]\n\n逐支付日列出两腿，按条件净额交换。"},
		{"id":"notional","type":"text","x":2420,"y":1580,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[衍生品名义本金]]\n\n本金或计算基数，不等于市值、保证金或最大损失。"},
		{"id":"payoffprofit","type":"text","x":3000,"y":1580,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[到期支付与投资损益]]\n\n正支付未必赚钱；计入权利金及期间现金流。"},
		{"id":"hedge","type":"text","x":40,"y":1990,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[套期保值]]\n\n合并原业务与对冲头寸；数量、基差和资金逐项检查。"},
		{"id":"cf","type":"text","x":620,"y":1990,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[国债期货转换因子]]\n\n标准收益率下的单位面值净价：97.2914 与 0.9729 不同。"},
		{"id":"accrued","type":"text","x":1200,"y":1990,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[债券应计利息]]\n\n先固定面值、付息区间和日计数。"},
		{"id":"invoice","type":"text","x":620,"y":2300,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[国债期货交割货款]]\n\n统一每百元报价：Q/100 × (F × CF + AI)。"},
		{"id":"alternative","type":"text","x":40,"y":2550,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[另类投资]]\n\n资产或策略分类；同时看底层与持有结构。"},
		{"id":"cds","type":"text","x":1200,"y":2550,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[CDS信用事件与结算]]\n\n信用事件保护合约，不是资产池优先/劣后分层。"},
		{"id":"hpr","type":"text","x":1840,"y":1990,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[持有期收益率]]\n\n价差 + 分配收入；明确币种、起止日期和投入基数。"},
		{"id":"means","type":"text","x":3000,"y":1990,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[算术与几何平均收益]]\n\n平均一期，与复现跨期财富增长，回答不同问题。"},
		{"id":"portreturn","type":"text","x":1840,"y":2340,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[单期组合收益]]\n\n先按该期期初权重汇总资产总回报。"},
		{"id":"ytm","type":"text","x":3000,"y":2340,"width":500,"height":140,"text":"### [[到期收益率与实现收益]]\n\n解承诺现金流的折现率，不保证实现同样回报。"},
		{"id":"return-bridge","type":"text","x":1840,"y":2570,"width":1660,"height":130,"text":"100 → 150 → 100：算术平均约 8.33%，几何平均 0%。\n\n[[02_Economy/06_证券投资学/01_证券工具与现金流权利#自检：把三个常见混淆拆开|回到课程自检]] · [[02_Economy/06_证券投资学/02_证券市场与交易|下一主题：这些权利怎样成交与结算]]"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e-stock-common","fromNode":"stock","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"common","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"依股份类别读分配权"},
		{"id":"e-stock-pref","fromNode":"stock","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"preferred","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"条款给特定优先权"},
		{"id":"e-bond-priority","fromNode":"bond","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"priority","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"违约时依顺序分配"},
		{"id":"e-limited-alloc","fromNode":"limited","fromSide":"right","toNode":"allocation","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"限追索"},
		{"id":"e-priority-security","fromNode":"priority","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"security","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"查担保资产及保证范围"},
		{"id":"e-nav-discount","fromNode":"nav","fromSide":"right","toNode":"discount","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"比市价"},
		{"id":"e-etf-mech","fromNode":"etf","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"etflink","toSide":"bottom","toEnd":"arrow","label":"创设赎回连接两层市场"},
		{"id":"e-forward-fut","fromNode":"forward","fromSide":"right","toNode":"futures","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"日结算"},
		{"id":"e-opt-call","fromNode":"option","fromSide":"right","toNode":"call","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"买入权"},
		{"id":"e-opt-put","fromNode":"option","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"put","toSide":"bottom","toEnd":"arrow","label":"给予卖出权利"},
		{"id":"e-swap-notional","fromNode":"swap","fromSide":"right","toNode":"notional","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"定规模"},
		{"id":"e-call-profit","fromNode":"call","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"payoffprofit","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"支付再扣建仓成本"},
		{"id":"e-cf-invoice","fromNode":"cf","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"invoice","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"乘于交割净价部分"},
		{"id":"e-ai-invoice","fromNode":"accrued","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"invoice","toSide":"right","toEnd":"arrow","label":"按相同面值另加利息"},
		{"id":"e-hpr-means","fromNode":"hpr","fromSide":"right","toNode":"means","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"多期总回报再聚合"},
		{"id":"e-port-hpr","fromNode":"portreturn","fromSide":"top","toNode":"hpr","toSide":"bottom","toEnd":"arrow","label":"资产回报汇成组合回报"}
	]
}
